msgstr ""
"To enable this, set `export HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE=\"AIV\"`\n"
""

msgid ""
"HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE环境变量用于配置通信算法的编排展开位置，支持如下取值：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The `HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE` environment variable configures the orchestration expansion position for communication algorithms. The supported values are as follows:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- AI_CPU：代表通信算法的编排展开位置在Device侧的AI CPU计算单元。\n"
"- AIV：代表通信算法的编排展开位置在Device侧的Vector Core计算单元。\n"
"- HOST：代表通信算法的编排展开位置为Host侧CPU，Device侧根据硬件型号自动选择相应的调度器。\n"
"- HOST_TS：代表通信算法的编排展开位置为Host侧CPU，Host向Device的Task Scheduler下发任务，Device的Task Scheduler进行任务调度执行。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- AI_CPU: Indicates that the communication algorithm is orchestrated and expanded on the AI CPU computing unit on the Device side.\n"
"- AIV: Indicates that the communication algorithm is orchestrated and expanded on the Vector Core computing unit on the Device side.\n"
"- HOST: Indicates that the communication algorithm is orchestrated and expanded on the Host side CPU. The Device side automatically selects the scheduler based on the hardware model.\n"
"- HOST_TS: Indicates that the communication algorithm is orchestrated and expanded on the Host side CPU. The Host sends tasks to the Device Task Scheduler for scheduling and execution.\n"
""

msgid ""
"下面介绍两种展开机制\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The following describes two rollout mechanisms.\n"
""

msgid ""
"##### HOST展开\n"
""
msgstr ""
"##### HOST Expansion\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 软件栈工作在host CPU，通信算法展开一个个task\n"
"- 每个task调用runtime接口，下发到device的rtsqueue\n"
"- STARS从rtsqueue上顺序拿取task\n"
"- 根据task类型分别调用SDMA和RDMA引擎。\n"
"  **单算子瓶颈**：hostbound 每个task提交是2~5us，一个通信算子有几百个task，单算子场景不会在device上缓存，下发一个执行一个\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- The software stack runs on the host CPU, and the communication algorithm expands into individual tasks.\n"
"- Each task calls the runtime interface and is dispatched to the rtsqueue on the device.\n"
"- STARS sequentially fetches tasks from the rtsqueue.\n"
"- STARS calls the SDMA and RDMA engines respectively based on the task type.\n"
"  **Single-operator bottleneck**: Each hostbound task submission takes 2-5us. A communication operator has hundreds of tasks. In the single-operator scenario, tasks are not cached on the device; one task is dispatched and executed at a time.\n"
""

msgid ""
"##### AICPU机制展开\n"
""
msgstr ""
"##### AICPU Mechanism Expansion\n"
""

msgid ""
"- host侧不下发一个个task，把通信算子作为一个个kernel，放在通信算子kernel的队列上去。\n"
"- STARS调度kernel队列流上的kernel，把kernel放到AiCPU上去执行。\n"
"- AICPU调用函数（kernel），用一个线程执行kernel 函数，在函数内把通信task展开，把task放到rtsqueue上，STARS调用。\n"
"- 降低host和aicpu交互，由几百次降低为一次。\n"
"- task的提交在AICPU上提交，做了提交的部分合并。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- The host side does not dispatch tasks one by one. Instead, it treats communication operators as individual kernels and places them on the communication operator kernel queue.\n"
"- STARS schedules the kernels on the kernel queue stream and dispatches them to the AiCPU for execution.\n"
"- The AiCPU calls the function (kernel) and uses a thread to execute the kernel function. Inside the function, it expands communication tasks and places them on the rtsqueue, and STARS invokes them.\n"
"- This reduces the interaction between the host and the AiCPU from hundreds of times to once.\n"
"- Tasks are submitted on the AiCPU, and partial merging of the submissions is performed.\n"
""

